# Crawler (the Dead): a corpse dragging itself on its belly, head low and forward, both arms clawing ahead, legs
# trailing behind. Rot-green eyes and a rot gash on the back (its light cue). Fast, fragile, low under the rifle line.
name crawler
grid 5
size 26 14 10
slot body Flesh
slot rag InkBrown
slot eye Rot
box 8 4 1 18 10 6 rag
beam 8 5 3 1 4 1 1.2 rag
beam 8 9 3 2 11 1 1.2 rag
box 18 5 3 23 9 8 body
box 22 5 6 23 6 8 eye
box 22 8 6 23 9 8 eye
beam 16 4 4 24 1 0 1.1 body
beam 16 10 4 24 13 0 1.1 body
box 11 6 6 15 8 7 eye
noise 0.15 9 rag
pivot 13 7 0
# R20 animation segments (Skitter gait roles: LegL and LegR sweep fore and aft about yaw). Diagonal pairs crawl
# together: LegL = left arm + right leg, LegR = right arm + left leg. The head bites.
part Head 18 4 2 26 10 10 18 7 5
part LegL 16 0 0 26 4 10 16 4 4
part LegL 0 9 0 8 14 10 8 9 3
part LegR 16 10 0 26 14 10 16 10 4
part LegR 0 0 0 8 6 10 8 5 3
